sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as 管理员
    participant Page as Admin.vue
    participant API as adminApi
    participant Auth as AuthInterceptor
    participant AC as AdminController
    participant AS as AdminServiceImpl
    participant RS as RecipeServiceImpl
    participant DB as MySQL

    Admin->>Page: 进入后台管理
    Page->>API: GET /api/admin/stat + user/list + recipe/list
    API->>Auth: Bearer token
    Auth->>Auth: 校验 role == ADMIN
    Auth->>AC: 放行管理请求
    AC->>AS: stat() / users() / recipes()
    AS->>DB: 统计用户、菜谱、分类、评论
    AS->>RS: 查询所有菜谱 includeDisabled=true
    RS->>DB: 分页查询 recipe
    AC-->>Page: 统计卡片与管理表格
    Admin->>Page: 点击菜谱上下架
    Page->>API: PUT /api/admin/recipe/{id}/disable
    API->>AC: 请求到达
    AC->>RS: toggleStatus(id)
    RS->>DB: 更新 recipe.status
    AC-->>Page: Result(200)
